		{"id":"d1c8f6e6f4f459ff","type":"text","text":"```\nSELECT * FROM products WHERE category = 'gift' AND released = 1\n```","x":4220,"y":600,"width":577,"height":80},
		{"id":"a51804d7b21cb361","type":"text","text":"# SQL INJECTION","x":-1060,"y":-297,"width":214,"height":60},
		{"id":"5d7fdf180f3ff1db","type":"text","text":"- `'` single character send karake dekho koi error aaya kya\n- kuchh syntax try kar sakte hai \n- Boolean value jaise -> `1=1` or `1=2` or response m dekho koi diffrece dekho\n- dekho koi payload dala hai to vo kitana time le raha hai execute hone m\n- OAST payload isi ke liye banaya gaya hai , dekho ye kitana time le raha hai execute hone m","x":-845,"y":-17,"width":740,"height":160},
		{"id":"f936d5fc8708aeab","type":"text","text":"sql injection 1 type ki vulnerablity hai , jo web application m payi jati hai , isaki help se ham data ko fetch kar sakte hai , and modify or delete bhi kar sakte h","x":-720,"y":-320,"width":490,"height":106},
		{"id":"bede645c82da4672","type":"text","text":"- jyadatar sql injection ki qry `where` or `select` ka use karati h\n\n- In `UPDATE` statements, within the updated values or the `WHERE` clause.\n- In `INSERT` statements, within the inserted values.\n- In `SELECT` statements, within the table or column name.\n- In `SELECT` statements, within the `ORDER BY` clause.","x":280,"y":-17,"width":572,"height":160},
		{"id":"c248a5f15fa8a066","type":"text","text":"Application SQL Injection attacks ko prevent/detect karne ke liye proper validation ya parameterized queries use nahi kar rahi.\n```\nhttps://insecure-website.com/products?category=Gifts'--\n```\n\n\n","x":140,"y":560,"width":540,"height":145},
		{"id":"959f708ae1c27a7b","type":"text","text":"```\nSELECT * FROM products WHERE category = 'Gifts'--' AND released = 1\n```","x":106,"y":820,"width":609,"height":80},
		{"id":"fa6b090001ed6f27","type":"text","text":"isake andar `--` iske bad ke sare comment ho jayenge or jo last mai likha hai ye `AND released = 1` ye bhi comment ho jayenge kis kam ke nahi h","x":460,"y":980,"width":584,"height":80},
		{"id":"96a45ab40a1bd61d","type":"text","text":"<center>Test</center>","x":-340,"y":820,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"895cf96b8cf9f341","type":"text","text":"```\nhttps://insecure-website.com/products?category=Gifts'+OR+1=1--\n```","x":-499,"y":1020,"width":569,"height":80},
		{"id":"6f6926171ab56af4","type":"text","text":"```\nSELECT * FROM products WHERE category = 'Gifts' OR 1=1--' AND released = 1\n```","x":-90,"y":1260,"width":664,"height":86},
		{"id":"dd90362b2a66aa52","type":"text","text":"```\nSELECT * FROM products WHERE category = 'Gifts' OR 1=1 \n```","x":-820,"y":1260,"width":506,"height":86},
		{"id":"9ba413dc0b235bfe","type":"text","text":"dono barabar h","x":-260,"y":1500,"width":145,"height":60},
		{"id":"9aca4ca3d2487293","type":"text","text":"> [!warning]\n\n\nTake care when injecting the condition `OR 1=1` into a SQL query. Even if it appears to be harmless in the context you're injecting into, it's common for applications to use data from a single request in multiple different queries. If your condition reaches an `UPDATE` or `DELETE` statement, for example, it can result in an accidental loss of data.\n\n[^1]: \n","x":-820,"y":1620,"width":705,"height":199},
		{"id":"8ca961c62d4648ec","type":"text","text":"<CENTER>\n\t<h1>LAB</h1>\n</center>\n\n## SQL injection vulnerability in WHERE clause allowing retrieval of hidden data","x":-820,"y":2160,"width":445,"height":140},
